# fnn

```txt
fnn stands for 'file name normaliser'. This program simply replaces the spaces
in a file name with an underscore to make working with files easier.
Filenames with spaces can be annoying in the cli because of the amount
escaping you have to do when working with the names.
```

# Installation

```txt
To install simply copy or move the script into your bin dir after
making sure it has executable permissions.
```
